  m_Name: brno-enc1-out
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  entryLines:
  - text: Ufff. To bylo o fous.
    speakerName: Branice
  - text: To nebylo o fous ale o plnovous.
    speakerName: "Kry\u0161tof"
  - text: "Co to bylo za starou\u0161ky?"
    speakerName: Branice
  - text: "To byli nejsp\xED\u0161 sta\u0159e\u0161inov\xE9. P\u016Fvodn\xED zakladatel\xE9
      pivovaru st\u0159e\u017E\xEDc\xED jeho z\xE1klady."
    speakerName: "Kry\u0161tof"
  - text: "Je mo\u017En\xE9 \u017Ee jich tu je\u0161t\u011B p\xE1r potk\xE1me, ale
      to pro tebe ur\u010Dit\u011B nebude probl\xE9m."
    speakerName: "Kry\u0161tof"
